WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.482
Some paint hit Sara. Splat!

2
00:00:11.483 --> 00:00:13.953
She wiped her face.

3
00:00:13.954 --> 00:00:16.331
Then . . .

4
00:00:16.332 --> 00:00:19.315
Sara scooped up paint.

5
00:00:19.316 --> 00:00:23.270
She threw the paint at her friends.

6
00:00:23.271 --> 00:00:25.953
"Ha-ha!" Rex said.

7
00:00:25.954 --> 00:00:28.331
"You missed me!"

8
00:00:28.332 --> 00:00:33.553
Tor laughed. "But you got me!"

9
00:00:33.554 --> 00:00:40.698
Sid laughed. "Try to get me!"

10
00:00:40.699 --> 00:00:45.059
Everyone flung paint at Sid.

11
00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:48.935
Sid ducked and dived.

12
00:00:48.936 --> 00:00:56.539
"This is so much fun!" Rex said.

13
00:00:56.540 --> 00:01:04.243
Soon everyone was tired.

14
00:01:04.244 --> 00:01:08.786
"Let's make a painting together," Sara said.

15
00:01:08.787 --> 00:01:14.743
"Great idea," Tor said.

16
00:01:14.744 --> 00:01:20.220
The buddies painted.

17
00:01:20.221 --> 00:01:24.833
A big painting filled one wall.

18
00:01:24.834 --> 00:01:28.202
"Hey!" Sid grinned.

19
00:01:28.203 --> 00:01:30.683
"It's us."

20
00:01:30.684 --> 00:01:35.995
"Our painting looks great!" Sara said.

21
00:01:35.996 --> 00:01:40.041
"But we are a mess," Tor said.

22
00:01:40.042 --> 00:01:43.510
"How will we get clean?"

23
00:01:43.511 --> 00:01:47.645
Rex heard raindrops outside the cave.

24
00:01:47.646 --> 00:01:50.892
He smiled.

25
00:01:50.893 --> 00:01:54.456
"Let's go play outside," Rex said.

26
00:01:54.457 --> 00:02:05.505
"The rain will wash away the paint!"

